xmlbird (1.2.15) unreleased;

  [ Johan Mattsson ]
  * Fix buffer resize in Elements
  * Fix platform check for Windows

  [ Mario Daniel Ruiz Saavedra ]
  * Migrate build system to Meson
  * Add AFL++ fuzzing target and GitHub Actions CI
  * Add attribute and child element mutation APIs to XmlElement and Elements
  * Add XML serialization (to_string and write_to) to XmlElement and XmlTree
  * Improve XML comment, processing instruction, and DOCTYPE handling
  * Fix assertion crash on attributes with empty local name after ':'
  * Replace Regex-based XmlParser.encode/decode to avoid crashes on invalid UTF-8
  * Support Meson subproject dependency resolution (override_dependency)
  * Switch internal diagnostics from custom print logging to GLib logging (G_LOG_DOMAIN="xmlbird")

 -- Mario Daniel Ruiz Saavedra <desiderantes93@gmail.com>

